==Battleground==
*1 [[Dagshund]] spawns after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*1 [[Celeboodle]] spawns after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*1 [[Celeboodle]] spawns after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>.
*1 [[Celeboodle]] spawns after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>.
*1 [[Dagshund]] spawns after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Sunny Celeboodle]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Celeboodle]]s spawn, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
**1 [[Master Da Xun]] spawns.
**1 [[Rain D.]] spawns.

==Strategy==
If you have [[Ramen Cat]] at level 30, the enemies can't advance, as his HP is just too high for them to pierce through before another joins. Combine this with [[Crazed Bahamut Cat]], and you'll be able to easily beat the stage. If you lack Ramen Cat, just use other spammable meatshields.

